@ framework/actors: load the archives of actor-spawner targets with the level
@ (code/spawn_resources.cpp, ledger F0223).

@ LoadProfileArchives(mode, parentHeap). Entry `push {r4-r9, r11, lr}`,
@ position-independent (sdk/data/hookable.csv).
SpawnRes_loadArchives:
    type:       hook
    address:    0x00008F10
    symbol:     ModBase::spawnerArchives::loadArchives(unsigned int, void*)
    trampoline: ModBase::spawnerArchives::loadArchives_orig(unsigned int, void*)

@ Profile_loadResources(profile, heap). Entry `ldrb r2, [r0, #0x10]`,
@ position-independent, so the trampoline can replay it.
SpawnRes_loadResources:
    type:       hook
    address:    0x00017FCC
    symbol:     ModBase::spawnerArchives::loadResources(Profile*, void*)
    trampoline: ModBase::spawnerArchives::loadResources_orig(Profile*, void*)
